      "side": 1,
      "message": "1.Both Cellular and Satellite are 2 different transports at Mobile. Until date Cellular network was supported under Mobile , now we have mobile supporting satellite network mode also . hence its better to go as it is getSubIdForMobile()\n\n2.Without this , when IMS was operating under Satellite Network , met with crash\n02-26 12:58:41.945853  1000  1379  1964 E AndroidRuntime: *** FATAL EXCEPTION IN SYSTEM PROCESS: NetworkStats\n02-26 12:58:41.945853  1000  1379  1964 E AndroidRuntime: java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Mobile state need capability TRANSPORT_CELLULAR\n02-26 12:58:41.945853  1000  1379  1964 E AndroidRuntime: \tat android.net.connectivity.com.android.server.net.NetworkStatsService.getSubIdForMobile(NetworkStatsService.java:2312)\n02-26 12:58:41.945853  1000  1379  1964 E AndroidRuntime: \tat android.net.connectivity.com.android.server.net.NetworkStatsService.handleNotifyNetworkStatusLocked(NetworkStatsService.java:2239)\n02-26 12:58:41.945853  1000  1379  1964 E AndroidRuntime: \tat android.net.connectivity.com.android.server.net.NetworkStatsService.handleNotifyNetworkStatus(NetworkStatsService.java:2157)\n\nHence this adding of new transport is necessary.\n\n3.Currently there is no requirement as such, of Satellite Network to have VT",
